PRONINX.img layout (512 byte sectors)

sector 0     protective MBR with stage_1. The BIOS loads it at 0x7c00.
sector 1     GPT header
sector 2     GPT entries (128)
sector 2048  EFI system partition, FAT32, label FNUESP, at least 64 MiB:
               /EFI/BOOT/BOOTX64.EFI  UEFI loader
               /fnu/kernel            kernel
               /fnu/ramdisk           root used when there is no fnu-root
then         fnu-boot, 1 MiB: stage2 as raw sectors
then         fnu-root, ROOT_MB: UFS2 root, made by makefs
then         fnu-swap, SWAP_MB (256 MiB): swap, the hibernation image and
             the kernel message dump at the end
last 33      backup GPT

BIOS: stage_1 loads stage2 from fnu-boot, stage2 reads the kernel and the
ramdisk from the ESP (boot/fat.c).
UEFI: the firmware runs BOOTX64.EFI, which reads the same files.
